# NOTE: `**/bin/` MUST NOT be listed here. The repository-root bin/ directory
# holds this module's normative command entrypoints (MODULE_BIN_SPEC.md §2) and
# the bin/lib wiring they source. A recursive bin/ glob matches the root bin/ as
# well, which makes every mandated entrypoint unstageable — that is why an
# earlier "land standard bin/ entrypoints" commit could delete the `/bin/` line
# and still record no scripts at all. Nested build output is covered by
# `**/build/` and `**/obj/`; `**/generated/**/bin/Release/` covers .NET publish
# output if one ever lands.
